{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>You shall not see your brother's ox</b> — The return of a lost item is juxtaposed to burial, for if he is a priest and he is in the cemetery, regarding this it is stated: והתעלמת — He gives to you. And juxtaposed to it is והתעלמת, to tell you: one who returns his own, returns also that of his fellow."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:10:12.752532727Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}